    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "How To: Add Image Context",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "# How To: Add Context for AI\n\nAI works best when it can see your design.\n\nAdding files like your prompt, webpage, or brand kit helps AI generate styling that matches your ideas.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/41a84d3ffd2a38785562ac41aec9b410-ai-curriculum-societal-impacts.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-image-context-test-2025-90f598cf-70ae-4ddf-8788-cdd69b931239",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 1:\n\nIf you created a sketch or design, save it to your Backpack.\n\nThen add it to your project so it appears in your file list.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/4536ea9bd4e5fde83ac959babdc95578-ezgif-1e69ef3640cc54ec.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-image-context-test-2025-fe585fd5-6be2-4d90-84a9-e04d332f1182",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 2:\n\nAdd the files you want AI to use as context.\n\nThis might include:\n- your plan or notes\n- your code files\n- any images or designs you're working with",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/45d726716891d3cbfaac2754aa678481-ezgif-156120c951e52128.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-image-context-test-2025-dcaeae89-d30c-404b-b479-06bfe7f8cc6c",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 3:\n\nIn the prompt box, describe what you want AI to do. \n\nMention the file by name so AI knows to use it as context. Send your prompt and review the output.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/d41e07beb6a74a5c9067897bdbf27ad5-Pasted Graphic 15.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-image-context-test-2025-6f5fae24-4402-428b-ba31-5bb8cc8526be"
      }
    ],
    "name_suffix": "_2026"
  },
